This crate is an unofficial Rust port of libphonenumber 9.0.41 (https://github.com/google/libphonenumber), Copyright
the libphonenumber authors (Google LLC), licensed under Apache-2.0. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google.

Carried from libphonenumber 9.0.41, unmodified and under its licence:
- the metadata files in resources/ (the runtime PhoneNumberMetadataProto_* files, the testing metadata, and the
  CountryCodeToRegionCodeMap files), copied verbatim by scripts/sync-metadata.sh. The metadata version is 9.0.41;
- upstream/libphonenumber, a git submodule pinned to the v9.0.41 tag, read-only, not part of the published package.

Ported behaviour, and the tests and inputs taken from libphonenumber's own test suite (tests/upstream_*.rs), remain
under libphonenumber's Apache-2.0 licence. The differential vectors in tests/vectors/ were recorded by running
libphonenumber 9.0.41 (scripts/record.sh).

Nothing was copied from libphonenumber's files under LICENSE.Chromium, so that licence is not carried here.

